<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Editar Música - Plataforma Musical</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #9c27b0;
            --primary-dark: #7b1fa2;
            --primary-light: #ba68c8;
            --background: #121212;
            --surface: #1e1e1e;
            --text-primary: #e1e1e1;
            --text-secondary: #b0b0b0;
            --error: #cf6679;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--background);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            transition: all 0.5s ease;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: var(--surface);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }
        
        .container:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2);
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: var(--primary-light);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.3);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.3); }
            50% { text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.5); }
            100% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.3); }
        }
        
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .form-group:focus-within {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }
        
        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--primary-light);
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        
        input[type="text"], 
        select, 
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        input[type="text"]:focus, 
        select:focus, 
        textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.3);
            background-color: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.05);
        }
        
        textarea {
            min-height: 180px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        
        .audio-preview {
            margin-top: 15px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            animation: slideIn 0.5s ease-out;
        }
        
        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
        }
        
        .audio-preview p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }
        
        audio {
            width: 100%;
            filter: invert(0.8) hue-rotate(270deg) brightness(0.8);
        }
        
        .status-options {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        
        .status-option {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .status-option input {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0;
        }
        
        .status-option label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px 15px 8px 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .status-option label:before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--text-secondary);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .status-option input:checked + label {
            background-color: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2);
            color: var(--primary-light);
        }
        
        .status-option input:checked + label:before {
            border-color: var(--primary-light);
            background-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .button-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        
        button {
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        button:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        
        button:after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            opacity: 0;
            border-radius: 100%;
            transform: scale(1, 1) translate(-50%);
            transform-origin: 50% 50%;
        }
        
        button:focus:not(:active)::after {
            animation: ripple 1s ease-out;
        }
        
        @keyframes ripple {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0, 0);
                opacity: 0.5;
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(20, 20);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }
        
        .save-btn {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .save-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.4);
        }
        
        .cancel-btn {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
        
        .cancel-btn:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        
        .delete-btn {
            background-color: var(--error);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .delete-btn:hover {
            background-color: #b00020;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(207, 102, 121, 0.4);
        }
        
        /* Animação para os inputs */
        input, select, textarea {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out;
            animation-fill-mode: both;
        }
        
        /* Delay para cada elemento */
        .form-group:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .form-group:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .form-group:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .form-group:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .form-group:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        
        /* Efeito de onda ao clicar */
        @keyframes wave {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.7); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0); }
        }
        
        .wave-effect {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .wave-effect:after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.5) 10%, transparent 10.01%);
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: 50%;
            transform: scale(10, 10);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: transform .5s, opacity 1s;
        }
        
        .wave-effect:active:after {
            transform: scale(0, 0);
            opacity: 0.3;
            transition: 0s;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container animate__animated animate__fadeIn">
        <h1 class="animate__animated animate__fadeInDown">Editar Música</h1>
        
        <form id="music-edit-form">
            <div class="form-group wave-effect">
                <label for="title">Título da Música</label>
                <input type="text" id="title" name="title" placeholder="Digite o título da música" value="{{musica.titulo}}" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group wave-effect">
                <label for="genre">Gênero Musical</label>
                <select id="genre" name="genre" class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
                    <option value="pop">Pop</option>
                    <option value="{{musica.genero}}" selected>{{musica.genero}}</option>
                    <option value="hiphop">Hip Hop</option>
                    <option value="electronic">Eletrônica</option>
                    <option value="jazz">Jazz</option>
                    <option value="classical">Clássica</option>
                    <option value="country">Country</option>
                    <option value="reggae">Reggae</option>
                    <option value="other">Outro</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group wave-effect">
                <label for="audio">Arquivo de Áudio</label>
            
                <div class="audio-preview animate__animated animate__fadeIn">
                    <p>Arquivo atual: musica_atual.mp3</p>
                    <audio controls>
                        <source src="/uploads/musicas/{{musica.audio}}">
                        Seu navegador não suporta o elemento de áudio.
                    </audio>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group wave-effect">
                <label for="lyrics">Letra da Música</label>
                <textarea id="lyrics" name="lyrics" placeholder="Digite a letra da música aqui..." class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">{{musica.letra}}</textarea>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
                <label>Status da Música</label>
                <div class="status-options">
                    <div class="status-option">
                        <input type="radio" id="status-active" name="status" value="active" checked>
                        <label for="status-active">Ativo</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-option">
                        <input type="radio" id="status-inactive" name="status" value="inactive">
                        <label for="status-inactive">Inativo</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-option">
                        <input type="radio" id="status-draft" name="status" value="draft">
                        <label for="status-draft">Rascunho</label>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="button-group animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
                <div>
                    <a href="/admin"><button type="button" class="cancel-btn wave-effect">Cancelar</button></a>
                    <button type="submit" class="save-btn wave-effect">Salvar Alterações</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>